    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/db97b892c2f5a8814c49547e95b20485.poster.avif?t=1739342360\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/db97b892c2f5a8814c49547e95b20485.webm?t=1739342360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/db97b892c2f5a8814c49547e95b20485.mp4?t=1739342360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Catapulted from your mundane reality into a realm facing apocalypse, you enter a world on the brink of destruction. Here, survival is paramount, requiring resourcefulness in gathering, building, and <strong>crafting amidst chaos</strong>. Your latent abilities are key, not just for survival, but for thriving and combating the darkness that hastens the world's end. This is an adventure of mastery and discovery in a land desperate for a savior to unveil its secrets and fend off the looming catastrophe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/c52aa7a9763af0e9553e8da9e68a7fca.avif?t=1739342360\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83e\udded Explore a vast world of beauty - and darkness<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f Construct campsites, fortifications, and settlements<br></li><li>\u2692\ufe0f Gather and utilize resources to forge your path forward<br></li><li>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Craft equipment and create custom weapons from pieces<br></li><li>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Create your hero from scratch<br></li><li>\ud83e\uddd9 Master the art of sorcery by tapping into arcane energies<br></li><li>\ud83e\ude78 Concoct potions to achieve a tactical upper hand<br></li><li>\ud83e\udd9e Cook mouth-watering meals for extra vigor and other boons<br></li><li>\ud83e\udddb\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Fight against the shadowy force menacing your new home<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfa3 Fish at the murky forgotten lakes of the world for a mysterious catch<br></li><li>\ud83d\udc1d Catch a variety of critters for use in crafting or just for a collection</li></ul> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/736f35138da1a3a2f78ef00b2e378602.avif?t=1739342360\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/8170ef30b67e08711f8a0c2f276cd9f5.webp?t=1739342360\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/21256b7bc8094d849c359fa6e7373d34.poster.avif?t=1739342360\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/21256b7bc8094d849c359fa6e7373d34.webm?t=1739342360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/21256b7bc8094d849c359fa6e7373d34.mp4?t=1739342360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You find yourself lost in a fantastical realm with no way back. Learn the lay of the land and the rules governing this strange place. Once you know where and what to look for, you can harness nearly everything you find to help you become the champion of your wildest dreams. Outfit your chosen hero with bespoke weapons and mystic armor hammered out from the resources of this strange world. Choose between aesthetics that would bewitch even the nobles or practical efficiency that would impress a blacksmith - the choice lies in your hands!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/9d668a2a2ac8808783040a1b2df14a9e.poster.avif?t=1739342360\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/9d668a2a2ac8808783040a1b2df14a9e.webm?t=1739342360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Unleash your creativity with the Modular Weapons System: Combine blades and handles to craft unique weapons with the characteristics you desire.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/e5541c815f4f2f81920dd87a1acda3d7.webp?t=1739342360\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/816856355f0879d9a264f9e156b1ccbf.poster.avif?t=1739342360\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/816856355f0879d9a264f9e156b1ccbf.webm?t=1739342360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/816856355f0879d9a264f9e156b1ccbf.mp4?t=1739342360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Make a camp, build a perimeter, expand it, build a house, build a forge - create a new home! You'll venture further into the expansive world by building camp sites and larger outposts along the way. Having a well equipped base can make all the difference when facing the challenges of this new fantastic frontier.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/9fbbcfe54c153bfebd469ed001bfeba4.webp?t=1739342360\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/705c200007a5798f21d9c9ec71f28c2a.poster.avif?t=1739342360\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/705c200007a5798f21d9c9ec71f28c2a.webm?t=1739342360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/705c200007a5798f21d9c9ec71f28c2a.mp4?t=1739342360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>After equipping yourself for the journey, a vast and enchanting universe awaits you. Delve into its abundant resources unearth hidden treasures, witness awe-inspiring wonders, brave treacherous perils, and unlock mysterious enigmas. Forge your domain by establishing camps, fortifications, and even prosperous settlements, expanding your influence across the realm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/fef9a5a990d7ba82c1739a6549ce7ca0.webp?t=1739342360\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/e211039103801c739a1e567153c73b88.poster.avif?t=1739342360\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/e211039103801c739a1e567153c73b88.webm?t=1739342360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/e211039103801c739a1e567153c73b88.mp4?t=1739342360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In your new life you will also uncover your hidden skills in arcana -  the sublime enchantment that breathes life into your newfound realm. The applications of arcana are many: Gathering, building, fighting, protecting and so on. It may be through magic that you finally find your way back home - should you so desire.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/5d56f852ab08503e1025e010a95813a9.webp?t=1739342360\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/ea778583c380b54200acd592f7ba6c87.avif?t=1739342360\" /></span><br><br>Beneath the tranquil facade, a sinister force is consuming the realm, spreading chaos, and driving the people into exile. Are you ready to steel yourself against the threat devouring these lands? It could be your destiny to steer this world clear of its impending doom...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/d6145ad1eb87712ba822ab9ee06f7861.webp?t=1739342360\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/friend.gif?t=1739342360\" /></span><br><br>You can conquer this strange new world alone - or you can bring a friend. Dysplaced allows you to bring along another dysplaced being for a shared experience in the dream-infused world where you will find both tranquility and excitement.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/db97b892c2f5a8814c49547e95b20485.poster.avif?t=1739342360\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/db97b892c2f5a8814c49547e95b20485.webm?t=1739342360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/db97b892c2f5a8814c49547e95b20485.mp4?t=1739342360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Catapulted from your mundane reality into a realm facing apocalypse, you enter a world on the brink of destruction. Here, survival is paramount, requiring resourcefulness in gathering, building, and <strong>crafting amidst chaos</strong>. Your latent abilities are key, not just for survival, but for thriving and combating the darkness that hastens the world's end. This is an adventure of mastery and discovery in a land desperate for a savior to unveil its secrets and fend off the looming catastrophe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/c52aa7a9763af0e9553e8da9e68a7fca.avif?t=1739342360\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83e\udded Explore a vast world of beauty - and darkness<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f Construct campsites, fortifications, and settlements<br></li><li>\u2692\ufe0f Gather and utilize resources to forge your path forward<br></li><li>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Craft equipment and create custom weapons from pieces<br></li><li>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Create your hero from scratch<br></li><li>\ud83e\uddd9 Master the art of sorcery by tapping into arcane energies<br></li><li>\ud83e\ude78 Concoct potions to achieve a tactical upper hand<br></li><li>\ud83e\udd9e Cook mouth-watering meals for extra vigor and other boons<br></li><li>\ud83e\udddb\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Fight against the shadowy force menacing your new home<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfa3 Fish at the murky forgotten lakes of the world for a mysterious catch<br></li><li>\ud83d\udc1d Catch a variety of critters for use in crafting or just for a collection</li></ul> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/736f35138da1a3a2f78ef00b2e378602.avif?t=1739342360\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/8170ef30b67e08711f8a0c2f276cd9f5.webp?t=1739342360\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/21256b7bc8094d849c359fa6e7373d34.poster.avif?t=1739342360\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/21256b7bc8094d849c359fa6e7373d34.webm?t=1739342360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/21256b7bc8094d849c359fa6e7373d34.mp4?t=1739342360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You find yourself lost in a fantastical realm with no way back. Learn the lay of the land and the rules governing this strange place. Once you know where and what to look for, you can harness nearly everything you find to help you become the champion of your wildest dreams. Outfit your chosen hero with bespoke weapons and mystic armor hammered out from the resources of this strange world. Choose between aesthetics that would bewitch even the nobles or practical efficiency that would impress a blacksmith - the choice lies in your hands!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.ste