ed.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/5d56f852ab08503e1025e010a95813a9.webp?t=1739342360\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/ea778583c380b54200acd592f7ba6c87.avif?t=1739342360\" /></span><br><br>Beneath the tranquil facade, a sinister force is consuming the realm, spreading chaos, and driving the people into exile. Are you ready to steel yourself against the threat devouring these lands? It could be your destiny to steer this world clear of its impending doom...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/d6145ad1eb87712ba822ab9ee06f7861.webp?t=1739342360\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430390/extras/friend.gif?t=1739342360\" /></span><br><br>You can conquer this strange new world alone - or you can bring a friend. Dysplaced allows you to bring along another dysplaced being for a shared experience in the dream-infused world where you will find both tranquility and excitement.",
